          <Pad Id="TLaBZlf7yWjhxbOVPIq2nL" Bounds="640,160,320,80" ShowValueBox="true" isIOBox="true" Value="&lt; {z} {x} {y} are replaced per tile. A template copied from a provider's documentation usually works unchanged. One without all three is refused, not guessed at.">
